+/// Widening (unreduced) degree-2 Monbijou multiply in the *sliced* representation: the three raw
+/// Karatsuba products `[t0, t1, t2] = [a0·b0, (a0+a1)·(b0+b1), a1·b1]` (each a `Wide` limb pair)
+/// of two GF(2^128) elements `[poly64x2_t; 2]`.
+///
